---
layout: layouts/app.njk
title: Word list
description: "Every word the reading lessons read, by level and by the lesson it is first read at, with the words read whole marked."
permalink: /words/
---
<div class="content">
  <header class="screen__head">
    <h1 class="screen__title">Word list</h1>
    <p class="screen__lead">Every word the reading lessons read, {{ program.words.length }} in all, under the lesson it is first read at. A word with a wavy line is read whole, because it does not follow its sounds. In Reading 2 a word in plain type is readable once its parts are taught, though no lesson teaches it by itself.</p>
  </header>

  {% for g in program.wordGroups %}
  <details class="fold" id="{{ g.level }}"{% if loop.first %} open{% endif %}>
    <summary><h2 class="fold__h">{{ g.levelName }} <span class="muted">({{ g.count }} words)</span></h2></summary>
    <div class="fold__body">
      {% for l in g.lessons %}
      <p class="eyebrow wl__lesson">Lesson {{ l.lesson }}</p>
      <ul class="wl">{% for w in l.words %}<li class="{% if w.whole %}is-whole{% endif %}{% if not w.taught %} is-later{% endif %}">{{ w.word }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </details>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
